flowchart TD
  EVT["Alchemy event payload"] --> PARSE["Parse block: logs / txs / callTracerTraces"]
  PARSE --> MATCH["Filter by target: addr / topic / selector"]
  MATCH --> DEC["Optional: ABI decode"]
  DEC --> RULES["rules-engine: RuleCheck"]
  RULES --> OUT{"matched?"}
  OUT -->|yes| ALERT["Telegram / logs"]
  OUT -->|no| DROP["Skip or debug only"]
